WEBVTT

00:08:29.505 --> 00:08:31.507
to disrupt their lives

00:08:31.549 --> 00:08:34.260
and spoil the village's reputation.

00:08:35.511 --> 00:08:40.849
I told them I was there to learn
about their lives and culture.

00:08:42.017 --> 00:08:44.979
By the end of our conversation,
an hour later,

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:48.315
these same men offered me tea and snacks.

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:52.027
Despite this incident,

00:08:52.069 --> 00:08:55.781
Beena and her family
wanted me to share her story

00:08:55.781 --> 00:08:56.949
with the world.

00:08:57.408 --> 00:08:59.368
Beena’s story matters,

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:01.120
so does Sugi's,